{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oops Simulator</strong> is a short walking experience set in a world that doesn\u2019t make sense \u2014 at least not at first glance.<br>Every street has its own rhythm, its own strange pattern to observe and follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, listen, and watch carefully. The city reacts to how aware you are.<br>There are no enemies to fight or puzzles to solve \u2014 just you, your steps, and the chaos around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find order in the mess... or will the mess find you first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that changes as you pay attention (or stop paying attention).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/d7b7a03b9ebf6275485387c0f435458a.poster.avif?t=1761130715\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/d7b7a03b9ebf6275485387c0f435458a.webm?t=1761130715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/d7b7a03b9ebf6275485387c0f435458a.mp4?t=1761130715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls \u2014 complex perception.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/6308ad01d86f78b911e7adcb99051f83.poster.avif?t=1761130715\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087250/extras/6308ad01d86f78b911e7adcb99051f83.webm?t=1761130715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source 